[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=21 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="补给艇的船尾比刚才更低。甲板上那些捆紧的桶没有动，你却听见下面有水晃。拉姆森把耳朵贴到舱盖上，听了一会儿，让大家都退开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="不是桶里。尾舱进水，得换一根拖缆。现在走，转弯的时候它会横过来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="这里能换？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="能，但是你得给我一段不被人追着的路。别让我一手拧阀门，一手猜你们什么时候开快。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻把望远镜递给你。你看见来路上仍有模糊的影子，离得不近，却一直没有离开。你想下令全队回头，帕金斯先把手放在海图边沿。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先说你想保护什么。是拖艇，还是我们刚走过的那一段海？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="拖艇。它换线的时候不能被追上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="那就留一条能继续走的缓冲路。回头打追兵，不一定比把它引开更安全。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你重新画线，让前方的舰先向宽水面展开，后方沿外侧慢慢跟。弗莱彻问拉姆森能不能跟上，直到她给了明确回答，才把命令读出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我和莫里照着后面。你别为了看见每个人，把自己也转到最危险的方向。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="如果两边同时过来呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们会报。你负责把消息放在一起，不用替每个人长一双眼。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="这句话比鼓励更有用。你把一条多余的折线擦掉，笔屑落进纸上湿过的地方，粘住了。你没有再抠它，先把拖艇的位置圈出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="还有一件事，换缆的时候我会关一个频道，怕手碰到发射。没回不等于出事，听帕金斯报我的位置。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="收到了。关之前说一声，再开也说一声。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="这条可以。比“你千万别有事”好执行。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你咽下那句本来已经到了嘴边的话。风把补给艇的破旗吹平，旗上只有一个简单编号，并不是什么会写进战报的船。你却知道如果今天把它丢在这里，刚才那条漂亮的航路就什么也没带回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="准备好就走。到下一段安全水面再检查，没有让你们追着打到尽头的命令。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["lamson", "fletcher", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

